  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The current codebase uses both the Jackson 1 and GSON libraries for handling JSON.  In addition, Modeshape by default includes Jackson 2, which is excluded.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Ideally, we should use Jackson 2 included with Modeshape.  If that is not possible for some reason, we should use a single JSON library.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
