  "description": "<p>The current codebase uses both the Jackson 1 and GSON libraries for handling JSON.  In addition, Modeshape by default includes Jackson 2, which is excluded.</p>\n\n<p>Ideally, we should use Jackson 2 included with Modeshape.  If that is not possible for some reason, we should use a single JSON library.</p>",
